    "intro_html":  "Biryani is the crown jewel of rice dishes: yogurt-marinated chicken steamed with spiced rice, buttery golden onions, mint, and a little jalapeno heat. This simplified batch version lands at \u003cstrong\u003e39 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 567 calories per bowl for about \u003cstrong\u003e$3.66\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Restaurant biryani wishes it had these unit economics.",
